---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
const pageSlug = 'features-unlock';
const articleLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'PIN, pattern or passphrase unlock',
  description: 'Unlock Vireault with a PIN, a 5×5, 10×10 or 25×25 pattern, or a passphrase, with optional fingerprint unlock and lockout after wrong attempts.',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Vireault' },
  datePublished: '2026-11-05',
  dateModified: '2026-11-21',
  mainEntityOfPage: 'https://vireault.app/features/unlock',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="PIN, pattern or passphrase unlock"
  description="Unlock Vireault with a PIN, a 5×5, 10×10 or 25×25 pattern, or a passphrase. Fingerprint unlock on compatible devices. Lockout after wrong attempts."
  path="/features/unlock"
  pageSlug={pageSlug}
  ogType="article"
  jsonLd={articleLd}
  article={{ published: '2026-11-05', modified: '2026-11-21' }}
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/features', label: 'Features' }, { label: 'Unlock' }]} />
    <article class="section prose">
      <h1>PIN, pattern or passphrase</h1>
      <p>Every vault needs an unlock secret. Vireault lets you pick the style that fits how you use the phone.</p>
      <h2>Supported unlock methods</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>PIN</strong> for quick numeric unlock</li>
        <li><strong>Pattern</strong> on a 5×5, 10×10 or 25×25 grid</li>
        <li><strong>Passphrase</strong> for longer secrets</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your secret feeds <a href="/features/encryption">Argon2id key derivation</a>. A new pattern uses one of those three grids. A 3×3 pad is still offered only when you unlock a vault that was created with one, or when you enter the current secret to change it. It is not offered for a new pattern. The lock screen starts on 5×5 and does not reveal which grid a vault uses.</p>
      <p>On compatible devices you can enable fingerprint unlock after unlocking with your secret. The first unlock after a reboot still requires that secret. Fingerprint unlock is unavailable in hidden-list mode.</p>
      <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} heading="Set up unlock in minutes" />
      <h2>Lockout and auto-lock</h2>
      <p>Wrong attempts lead to lockout. The app also locks when it goes to the background or after about five minutes idle, and screenshot blocking is enabled to reduce casual capture of open vault contents.</p>
      <h2>Several vaults, several secrets</h2>
      <p>With <a href="/features/multiple-vaults">multiple vaults</a>, each vault can use its own secret. Free plan includes one vault.</p>
      <p>More context: <a href="/guides/how-to-hide-photos-on-android">how to hide photos on Android</a> and <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
